	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Valde lassus sum, charissime mi frater, et multis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>moeroribus prope fractus; proinde, si brevior sum, excusa<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>tum me habebis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quantum ad summam rei, contuli cum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>consulibus, contuli cum aliis viris piis et prudentibus, omnesque suam <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>pollicentur operam.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="de">Diewyl aber der handel nitt unser alein ist, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>sunder gemeiner eydgnossen, kan <placeName ref="l587">Zürych</placeName> für sich selbs alein nitt <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>handlen; was man kan und mag, wirt man nütißter minder thuͦn.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Engedinenses venerunt; sed audio admodum ineptos se praebuisse <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>in senatu.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sed ne nunc quidem solidum dedere responsum; expectant <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>certiora a suis.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Interea <placeName ref="l801">Tugium</placeName> et nescio quo abierunt.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Heri redisse dicuntur; nam promiserant se responsuros die Iovis.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Sub vesperam fui cum consulibus, nec dum quicquam certi de responso <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>constabat.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Cras in senatu agetur c[aus]a, maxime cum legatus et senatus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/><placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> scripserint.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Doleo <persName>Friderychum</persName> se illis credidisse homin<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ibus; cum enim huc unice respectent, ut undique cor<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>radant impensas factas, solvet et hic symbolum.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Recte facis, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>qui dicas, nihil amplius ad te pertinere c[aus]am G[allicii], quippe quae <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>disceptata sit apud amplissimum senatum; reperit deus aliquando nocentem.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Rectius multo facis, qui nolis ullam cum illo exercere ini<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>micitiam, quam cum ecclesiae malo coniunctam fore dubium non est.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Si non perturbato essem animo, nuper tibi gratias egissem <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>pro Responsione tua mihi dono data; nunc vero te oro con<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>donare mihi digneris hoc peccatum.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Ago tibi gratias maximas pro libello <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>misso et altero <persName>Martinengo</persName> dato, qui sane exemplum, ut dixit, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>mihi dedit.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Alterum itaque cedet tuo nomine genero meo <persName ref="p1884">La<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>vatero</persName>.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Fateor me tibi suasisse, ne rabulis illis responderes; <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>sed nollem te meo obsequtum consilio.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Utilis est liber ecclesiae.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Si tamen scurrae isti te iterum invaserint, vide ut paratus <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>sis, si modo huiusmodi fuerint, ad quae respondere necesse sit etc.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Cur nolim acta a nostris postulare, prius tibi caussam <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>dixi; non est, quod repetam.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Si tamen per ocium aliquid communicare <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>poteris, plurimum mihi gratificaberis.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Remitto tibi, quae <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>repetisti, necdum describere licuit, imo vix legere.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Cupis scire, quid effecerint apud senatum <placeName ref="l638">Engadinenses</placeName>; nihil, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>prout paulo ante commemoravi.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p18575">Rex Hispaniae</persName> debuit si<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>gillum pactioni inter Sabaudum et <placeName ref="l41">Bernenses</placeName> appendere; noluit, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>ne videatur cognato male facere <foreign xml:lang="de">und inn hälffen umb das sin bringen.</foreign></s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Itaque audio omnia abiisse in fumum; certiora expecto.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z39"/><persName ref="p182">Arnoldo Suͤlern</persName> hab ich 14 malter haber zuͦ kouffen gäben, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>wie er hie was; den halben teyl solt er verganges frytags <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>mir bezallt haben, bringt 18 gl. 8 β; den andern halben teyl <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>sol er one fälen mir bezalen über 8 oder 14 tag.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de">Da hat <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>er mir anzeigt, <persName>Jörg Setzstab</persName> werde mich abfertigen umb <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>das halb.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="de">Wie ich zuͦ imm geschickt umb das gällt, was er <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>nitt willig, schluͦg mirs ab.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="de">Doch kumpt er hütt und <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>bringt mir 18 gl. und bitt mich hoch, <persName>Arnolden</persName> zuͦ schryben, <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>das er inn nitt lasse und imm das faß mitt rys, <lb xml:id="p1z48"/>wie er zuͦgesagt, imm schicke; dann er bloß amm gällt <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>sye, heige doch mir das gelegt etc.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="de" ana="salute">Bitten, ir wöllind das <lb xml:id="p1z50"/><persName>Arnolden</persName> anzeigen und inn früntlich gruͤssen.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z51"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 27. aprilis 1565.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta consules, d. legatum etc.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z52"/>Von <placeName ref="l157">Franckfurt</placeName> noch nüt etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z53"/>Tuus, qui semper.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8009">Ioanni <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Fabritio Montano</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae ministro <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>fideli, domino meo colendo <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>et fratri charissimo.</s>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
